<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #05014c, #1a3a8f); text-align: center; padding: 32px 20px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
    .header h1 { color: #fff; margin: 0; font-size: 22px; }
    .header p { color: #c7d2fe; margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .content { background: #fff; padding: 28px 24px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .details { background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #05014c; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .notice { background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #1e3a8a; }
    .details table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    .details td { padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; }
    .details td:first-child { color: #6b7280; width: 40%; }
    .details td:last-child { font-weight: 600; color: #111827; }
    .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; background: #f8f9fa; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Plot Purchase Request</h1>
      <p>Bank payment details</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <span class="badge">✓ Request Received</span>
      <p>Dear <strong><%= firstname %> <%= lastname %></strong>,</p>
      <p>We have received your request to buy this plot. Please use the bank details below to make payment, then bring your receipt to our office at Kumasi Dichemso to finalize the sale.</p>
      <div class="details">
        <table>
          <tr><td>Location</td><td><%= plotArea %></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Plot</td><td><%= plotDetails %></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Plot Size</td><td><%= plotSize %></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Amount Due</td><td><%= amount %></td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="details">
        <table>
          <tr><td>Bank Name</td><td>STANBIC BANK</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Account Name</td><td>LAND AND HOMES CONSULT</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Cedis Account</td><td>9040009771047</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Dollar Account</td><td>9040011449268</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Branch</td><td>KNUST, KUMASI-GHANA</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="notice">
        <strong>Next Step:</strong> Pay at the bank and bring your receipt to our Kumasi Dichemso office. Call 0322008282 / +233 54 855 4216 if you need help.
      </div>
      <p>If you have any questions, please contact us at <a href="mailto:landandhomesconsult@gmail.com">landandhomesconsult@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      <p>Best regards,<br><strong>The Get One Plot Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Get One Plot. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
